{"3861870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Future? No Thanks!", "steam_appid": 3861870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utopia is here. You're not impressed.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future? No Thanks! is a narrative-driven, open-world adventure set in an ecosocialist utopia. The year is 2045, and society has never been better: climate change is finally being tackled, democracy thrives, and technology serves  the public good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's just one problem: you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Harvey Huffstone, a grumpy elder who no longer fits in, and today is the last day of your life. <br>Your final mission? Completing your bucket list before your self-scheduled euthanasia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in outdated pleasures, explore a post-post-industrial Midwest, clash with a society that's moved on without you, and maybe, just maybe, leave with fewer regrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861870/extras/cb523751305f5d7c4ccc7fe57706e091.avif?t=1787192226\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861870/extras_big/cb523751305f5d7c4ccc7fe57706e091.webp?t=1787192226 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lively city, meet its wacky inhabitants, and complete 7 non-linear quests over 6 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861870/extras/ca2dcc3256e309dd705cc4195b4562d5.avif?t=1787192226\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861870/extras_big/ca2dcc3256e309dd705cc4195b4562d5.webp?t=1787192226 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An artisanal game made with locally sourced talent and minimal involvement from capitalists, marketers, or profiteers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861870/extras/222a6fd62dee942fd065d53f5adfee8f.avif?t=1787192226\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861870/extras_big/222a6fd62dee942fd065d53f5adfee8f.webp?t=1787192226 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a medium dominated by dystopias, Future? No Thanks! imagines a political project for the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utopia is here. You're not impressed.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future? No Thanks! is a narrative-driven, open-world adventure set in an ecosocialist utopia. The year is 2045, and society has never been better: climate change is finally being tackled, democracy thrives, and technology serves  the public good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's just one problem: you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Harvey Huffstone, a grumpy elder who no longer fits in, and today is the last day of your life. <br>Your final mission? Completing your bucket list before your self-scheduled euthanasia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in outdated pleasures, explore a post-post-industrial Midwest, clash with a society that's moved on without you, and maybe, just maybe, leave with fewer regrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/38618